  scope:pair('水平直線、先等速反應再定減速；不含坡度、黏著限制、制動建立時間或車列縱向動力。這不是列車實際制動曲線或行車許可。','Level straight motion: constant speed during reaction, then constant deceleration. Grade, adhesion, brake build-up and train dynamics are excluded. This is not an operational braking curve or movement authority.'),
